      "en": "You see many things, but don’t observe. His ears are open, but he doesn’t listen.",
      "ko": "네가 많은 것을 볼찌라도 유의치 아니하며 귀는 밝을찌라도 듣지 아니하는도다",
      "source_text_hash": "5c12f5ca9860d41fb9ac1ac5023cb420bfe6245e61611b9e3bc910aa4e87c394",
      "translation_text_hash": "76c75037470ea83f41efa0d871edfbea5531af98c90066ee8ba2c711ae88d69c",
