        "verse": 22
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "ISA",
          "chapter": 42,
          "verse": 22
        }
      ],
      "en": "But this is a robbed and plundered people. All of them are snared in holes, and they are hidden in prisons. They have become captives, and no one delivers, and a plunder, and no one says, ‘Restore them!’",
      "ko": "이 백성이 도적 맞으며 탈취를 당하며 다 굴속에 잡히며 옥에 갇히도다 노략을 당하되 구할 자가 없고 탈취를 당하되 도로 주라 할 자가 없도다",
      "source_text_hash": "fd7fd4ea804c24d5df72065e94d9453f42cefb19545ba3a0f54062cd5e38bf68",
      "translation_text_hash": "d43dc1308202bff0d1622e924a881349b7f52fca2c14a4c703cce23dc0b047c6",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
