      "en": "Who is there among you who will give ear to this? Who will listen and hear for the time to come?",
      "ko": "너희 중에 누가 이 일에 귀를 기울이겠느냐 누가 장래사를 삼가 듣겠느냐",
      "source_text_hash": "bb2cba88463dcf0f303118578e4a0417f61d80cd3c1e091816e46b2344bdfcbf",
      "translation_text_hash": "2a65e9e0389d834183b7d20f7422091cc9adfff74e052f7a213d0ca1d880e086",
